<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Valentine's Day</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Great+Vibes&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB6C1 0%, #FFFFFF 50%, #FFC0CB 100%);
            color: #DC143C;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
            animation: fadeIn 2s ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; }
            to { opacity: 1; }
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 600px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 3em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #DC143C;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 1.5em;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        .hearts {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .heart {
            position: absolute;
            color: #FF69B4;
            font-size: 2em;
            animation: float 6s linear infinite;
        }

        .heart:nth-child(1) { left: 10%; animation-delay: 0s; }
        .heart:nth-child(2) { left: 20%; animation-delay: 1s; }
        .heart:nth-child(3) { left: 30%; animation-delay: 2s; }
        .heart:nth-child(4) { left: 40%; animation-delay: 3s; }
        .heart:nth-child(5) { left: 50%; animation-delay: 4s; }
        .heart:nth-child(6) { left: 60%; animation-delay: 5s; }
        .heart:nth-child(7) { left: 70%; animation-delay: 6s; }
        .heart:nth-child(8) { left: 80%; animation-delay: 7s; }
        .heart:nth-child(9) { left: 90%; animation-delay: 8s; }
        .heart:nth-child(10) { left: 15%; animation-delay: 9s; }

        @keyframes float {
            0% { transform: translateY(100vh) rotate(0deg); opacity: 1; }
            100% { transform: translateY(-100vh) rotate(360deg); opacity: 0; }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            body, .heart { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }
        }

        .envelope-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 30px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .envelope {
            width: 300px;
            height: 200px;
            background: #fff;
            border: 2px solid #DC143C;
            border-radius: 5px;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.6s ease;
            perspective: 1000px;
        }

        .envelope:hover:not(.opened) {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .envelope::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 50%;
            background: #FFB6C1;
            border: 2px solid #DC143C;
            border-bottom: none;
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
            transition: all 0.6s ease;
            transform-origin: top center;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .envelope.opened::before {
            transform: rotateX(-180deg) translateZ(100px);
            opacity: 0;
        }

        .envelope::after {
            content: '❤️';
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            font-size: 3em;
            opacity: 0.5;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
            z-index: 5;
        }

        .envelope.opened {
            opacity: 0;
            visibility: hidden;
            transition: opacity 0.4s ease, visibility 0.4s ease;
        }

        .envelope.opened::after {
            opacity: 0;
        }

        .open-btn {
            padding: 12px 30px;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #DC143C, #FF69B4);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .open-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .open-btn:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .letter {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            display: none;
            animation: slideIn 0.6s ease 0.3s both;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        .letter.show {
            display: block;
        }

        @keyframes slideIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            h1 {
                font-size: 2em;
            }
            p {
                font-size: 1.2em;
            }
            .container {
                padding: 15px;
                margin: 10px;
            }
            .envelope {
                width: 250px;
                height: 170px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="hearts">
        <div class="heart" aria-hidden="true">❤️</div>
        <div class="heart" aria-hidden="true">❤️</div>
        <div class="heart" aria-hidden="true">❤️</div>
        <div class="heart" aria-hidden="true">❤️</div>
        <div class="heart" aria-hidden="true">❤️</div>
        <div class="heart" aria-hidden="true">❤️</div>
        <div class="heart" aria-hidden="true">❤️</div>
        <div class="heart" aria-hidden="true">❤️</div>
        <div class="heart" aria-hidden="true">❤️</div>
        <div class="heart" aria-hidden="true">❤️</div>
    </div>
    <div class="envelope-wrapper">
        <div class="envelope" id="envelope"></div>
        <button class="open-btn" id="openBtn">Open</button>
        <div class="container letter" id="letter">
            <h1>Hi My Valentine ❤️</h1>
            <p>I didn't need time to think.<br>
            The answer was already in my heart.</p>
            <p>Yes… I want to be your Valentine.</p>
            <p>Even with distance between us, I feel close to you.<br>
            Tonight is ours, in our own way.<br>
            And I'm choosing you.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        const envelope = document.getElementById('envelope');
        const openBtn = document.getElementById('openBtn');
        const letter = document.getElementById('letter');

        openBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
            envelope.classList.toggle('opened');
            letter.classList.toggle('show');
            openBtn.textContent = envelope.classList.contains('opened') ? 'Close' : 'Open';
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
